    $$
    \tilde{b^j_i} \tilde{b^i_k} \tilde{b^k_j} = c^j_m a^l_i c^i_j a^h_k c^k_n a^m_j b^m_l b^l_h b^n_m.
    = b^m_l b^l_h b^h_m = B_3
    $$

    只需对$(3,3)$型张量$F(\alpha^1,\alpha^2,\alpha^3,v_1,v_2,v_3) := 
    \alpha^1(f(v_2))\alpha^2(f(v_3))\alpha^3(f(v_1)) $缩并三次即可表示出$B_3$。

